 laughs it off completely  forgetting about nobuoaki's existence  back in school the hurt is too much for  chimi to take she dies six months after  the incident a new girl arrives at  another school in a different town she  is welcomed by chimi who turns out to  still be alive because of the curse the  king's game will continue until she  finds a way to end it herself  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching


